### CustomerPolicy API Testing Examples
### Save as: LicInsurance.Api.CustomerPolicy.http

### ========================================
### GET ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Get All Customer Policies
GET https://localhost:5001/api/customerpolicies
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Customer Policy by ID
GET https://localhost:5001/api/customerpolicies/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Policies for a Specific Customer
GET https://localhost:5001/api/customerpolicies/customer/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Policies by Status for a Customer (Active)
GET https://localhost:5001/api/customerpolicies/customer/1/status/Active
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Policies by Status for a Customer (Expired)
GET https://localhost:5001/api/customerpolicies/customer/1/status/Expired
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Policies by Status for a Customer (Cancelled)
GET https://localhost:5001/api/customerpolicies/customer/1/status/Cancelled
Accept: application/json

###

### ========================================
### POST ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Create New Customer Policy
POST https://localhost:5001/api/customerpolicies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "policyId": 1,
  "purchaseDate": "2024-01-15",
  "expiryDate": "2025-01-15",
  "status": "Active",
  "premiumAmount": 5000.00,
  "paymentFrequency": "Monthly",
  "lastPaymentDate": "2024-12-15",
  "nextPaymentDueDate": "2025-01-15",
  "remarks": "Policy enrolled for customer",
  "isActive": true
}

###

### Create Customer Policy - Quarterly Payment
POST https://localhost:5001/api/customerpolicies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "policyId": 2,
  "purchaseDate": "2024-03-01",
  "expiryDate": "2025-03-01",
  "status": "Active",
  "premiumAmount": 12500.00,
  "paymentFrequency": "Quarterly",
  "nextPaymentDueDate": "2025-04-01",
  "remarks": "Quarterly premium policy",
  "isActive": true
}

###

