### Create Customer Policy - Pending Status
POST https://localhost:5001/api/customerpolicies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 2,
  "policyId": 1,
  "purchaseDate": "2025-01-10",
  "expiryDate": "2026-01-10",
  "status": "Pending",
  "premiumAmount": 5000.00,
  "paymentFrequency": "Monthly",
  "remarks": "Policy awaiting approval",
