### ========================================

### Update Customer Policy - Change Status to Inactive
PUT https://localhost:5001/api/customerpolicies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "policyId": 1,
  "purchaseDate": "2024-01-15",
  "expiryDate": "2025-01-15",
  "status": "Inactive",
  "premiumAmount": 5000.00,
  "paymentFrequency": "Monthly",
  "lastPaymentDate": "2024-12-15",
  "nextPaymentDueDate": "2025-01-15",
  "remarks": "Policy put on hold",
  "isActive": false
}

